       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "s28783f30360",
       "text": "Agents are production systems now. They take irreversible actions in the world \u2014 sends, deploys, payments, filings. Governing them with prompt tips is like governing a fleet with sticky notes. Prompt engineering was the tutorial level. Reliability engineering is the game.",
